"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Latest master (aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4)\n- all versions after 4.4dev5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.rc (322e93592) - Windows 10.0.26100 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - Radeon RX 580 Series (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21921.1000) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9600K CPU @ 3.70GHz (6 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAny attempt at building Godot for 32-bit Windows will _succeed_, but then actually trying to run will crash with this\n\n```\n================================================================\nCrashHandlerException: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.4.dev.custom_build (55e55b4879f7ad89086aa26f2e53882cf85077f9)\nDumping the backtrace.\n-- END OF BACKTRACE --\n================================================================\n```\n\nAnd just stop. And for some bizarre reason, it _does not_ crash if its a dev build with debug symbols? (`dev_mode=\"yes\" dev_build=\"yes\"`)\n~~I'm still not sure if this is a Godot issue or a compiler issue.~~ This is a Godot issue, see next comment.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use the [latest](https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw/releases/tag/20241203) LLVM MinGW (can be older too, I tested [20231128](https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw/releases/tag/20231128)\n2. Compile for windows with `arch=\"x86_32\"`\n3. Wait for compilation and try to run the executable.\n4. (extra) re-compile with `dev_mode=\"yes\" dev_build=\"yes\"` and see how it does not crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nUse this link to get [the builds](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JScMvI4kSS9Bes-v7gVCgdHIF3ObBGKa?usp=sharing) and test it yourself:\n","closed_by":{"login":"MBCX","id":63003002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAzMDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63003002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX","html_url":"https://github.com/MBCX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100163/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}